240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5791,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T22:40:26Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-02-05T01:24:02Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T20:09:45Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115889","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115889","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115889.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115889.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"### Problem\r\n\r\n`AudioStreamWAV::save_to_wav` writes sample data to the file sample-by-sample. Just like with reading, this way is extremely unoptimal.\r\n\r\n### Solution?\r\n\r\n1. Make a 4KiB buffer\r\n2. While there is data for us to write...\r\n\t1. Copy next bytes into the buffer\r\n\t2. If the format is 8 bits, do the necessary conversion inside the buffer\r\n\t3. Write the entire buffer at once\r\n\t\r\nVirtually a lesson learned from #115235, where the change would make things slower due to sample-by-sample read.\r\n\t\r\nFor 16-bit, a more optimal solution would be to write the entire buffer at once, but I wanted the solution to be as unified as possible. Moreover, 4KiB already gives us a significant boost while using minimal memory.\r\n\r\nBefore, storing an average 2 second 16-bit stereo data means ***176400*** store operations, for each sample. After this PR, it gets reduced to around 87 as it isn't limited to sample-by-sample.\r\n\r\n### Benchmark\r\n\r\nTime it takes to save a 351.60s WAV file 8 times in a row:\r\n| Avg. time before | Avg. time after |\r\n|-|-|\r\n| 8148.375ms | 585.787ms |\r\n\r\nIn average, saving a WAV file the new way is 13.9x faster.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115889/reactions","total_count":23,"+1":11,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":8,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115889/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}